  {"name":"keys are limited separately","input":[["RateLimiter","allow","allow","allow","allow","allow"],[["fixed",1,10],["ana",0],["ana",1],["bo",1],["bo",2],["ana",10]]],"expected":[null,1,0,1,0,1]},
  {"name":"a limit of zero denies everything in every algorithm","input":[["RateLimiter","allow","RateLimiter","allow","RateLimiter","allow"],[["fixed",0,10],["ana",0],["sliding",0,10],["ana",0],["token",0,5],["ana",0]]],"expected":[null,0,null,0,null,0],"edge":true},
